  "Description": "Deforms a mesh with skin weights and skinning matrices on the GPU.\n\nConnect the Mesh and SkinWeights outputs of a [LoadGltfScene] with a rigged model and the matrices from [PoseToSkinMatrices]. The result is a regular mesh in the standard vertex layout, so it can be rendered and processed like any other mesh.",
